{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2bf0de4578b961a7d9080147bebb0561775bdc1f45f6a3352b93678b555ade3b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"blushyes/coro-code@679c57af5376 snapshot d60a9546779f7cea","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_69aa9dc53961ed1db10d592a822b11c9d1e811cba2ac67e4d1b6e3e854bdf553","slc_d97c1e7050876917d78667139b854cfe11658339c1a1789ca889c0cc42052873","slc_f962c282ce66bc215003d44e92c4d976b40ab3cc39f2e79d0650a1c7a61815ac"],"source_ids":["src_87dc71e2c99d5f76b6f90c47974a473b"],"text":"The CLI binary is named `coro`; it can run in interactive mode or accept a single task as a direct argument, and supports a `--config` flag pointing to a custom JSON config file.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2f711fbe0e5285214b5d14384f3dc2a0c4c3b5c9e3a221706edebbaa9d95db18","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"blushyes/coro-code@679c57af5376 snapshot d60a9546779f7cea","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_21d7ed92eb2d30ae3d258c8ca012ad12808fd95d51f245391413fe02b8883a26","slc_ce27a22732dbfc5cd11680f03372a6c9c5984fad9c7b6b146c0109ce4d2016e0"],"source_ids":["src_87dc71e2c99d5f76b6f90c47974a473b"],"text":"Installation is via `cargo install --git https://github.com/Blushyes/coro-code --bin coro`; prerequisites are Rust stable 1.70+ and an API key, with OpenAI recommended and Anthropic/Google noted as coming soon.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_420a3d43d798aa7969f8186ffea262c5ab3bd41ee42e5e2a00cda3239737d957","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"blushyes/coro-code@679c57af5376 snapshot d60a9546779f7cea","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2182ff141de60d8cc3761e839c49aa076020c6669b3aab7825b6bf5a68db40a2"],"source_ids":["src_87dc71e2c99d5f76b6f90c47974a473b"],"text":"The persistence snapshot contains conversation_history, AgentExecutionContext, and optional AgentConfig; on restore the saved config is applied, unpaired tool results are handled automatically, and system prompts are re-injected by the agent as needed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6b2bbe199eda7e43e3192109650caa6134868244fe9a1875d3416af6a324589f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"blushyes/coro-code@679c57af5376 snapshot d60a9546779f7cea","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7278e92d229f4b5e420a5bfad76c170917065457d9cdb9c8ea2027333c9425e4"],"source_ids":["src_87dc71e2c99d5f76b6f90c47974a473b"],"text":"Coro Code is described as a high-performance AI coding agent written in Rust with a rich terminal UI, formerly named Trae Agent Rust and kept compatible with the original tool spec.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8ae7d19b5dcc47fc7fb6c523825502a51ab6182d7bf1fecabf67369fd8cddd1d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"blushyes/coro-code@679c57af5376 snapshot d60a9546779f7cea","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e20a39021f58919107072df054119b9fcd47ebab8221aacdf5883ac05f4c90b0"],"source_ids":["src_7d017db435405e92b496f285cc896593"],"text":"The Chinese README lists built-in tools including bash, edit, json_edit, thinking, task_done, ckg, and mcp, plus Git-aware file search using @path syntax.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","created_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9556d28f055dbb68eb513c67ac54ecd299e619901ede627f5e45fa05d951b44a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"blushyes/coro-code@679c57af5376 snapshot d60a9546779f7cea","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_240156e473798734bcd43b5db3162e528e516bf827aa86a01b34b463fc1557e1","slc_54a66b3adb40e2690f7721596a2d7aede03c04c8c68cb0e44bf14703cf7800a0","slc_6b7e427dd2cb85d85a5ee79bb09403a9e6a86f319debaf49c5f90e6f549eabce","slc_70cee43e8aac600f7a8c2e04044b2146125f01dae664a9638330b71227aa4483","slc_a7e02b4915ed0ed8fed56a4ecd35649a5d94a8433818c6cd0701777cbf799d95"],"source_ids":["src_87dc71e2c99d5f76b6f90c47974a473b"],"text":"Configuration can be supplied via environment variables (OPENAI_API_KEY, OPENAI_MODEL, OPENAI_BASE_URL, and generic CORO_BASE_URL/CORO_MODEL overrides) or a `coro.json` file specifying protocol, base_url, api_key, model, and sampling params such as max_tokens, temperature, and top_p.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:37:57Z","updated_by_operation":"op_732e7f6aef6a48409dc0ea7f6a61b183"}
